      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How much can I get for my diamond ring?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "It depends on the diamond's 4Cs, the setting, current market conditions, and overall condition. The most reliable way to find out is an in-person evaluation, where a specialist can assess your specific ring and explain the offer."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Do I need a GIA certificate to sell my diamond ring?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "No. A certificate can help, but a reputable buyer can evaluate your diamond in person without one and walk you through their assessment."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Is getting an evaluation free? Am I obligated to sell?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "A free, no-obligation evaluation means exactly that — you learn what your ring is worth with no pressure and no requirement to accept an offer."
      }
    },
